    <bpmn:process id="W_W4169" name="W4169. Facilities Management Strategy &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy refresh; growth (10–15 stores/yr); cost/service pressure
Frequency: Annual + on major change
Volume: Enterprise footprint (~205 sites; ~1.6–3.0M sqm selling + ~130,000 sqm DC + ~3,000 sqm HQ)
Owner: Head of Facilities / Store Operations Support
Participants: COO, Store Ops (VS-07), Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Procurement (VS-34), Finance (VS-17.4), Facilities Coordination Specialist
Source: workflow W4169 — Facilities Management Strategy &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4169_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4169_Lane1" name="Head of Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4169_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4169_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4169_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4169_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4169_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4169_Start3" name="Strategy refresh; growth (10–15 stores/yr); cost/service pressure">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4169_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4169_Task4" name="Facilities define the IFM operating model — in-house vs outsourced per service…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities define the IFM operating model — in-house vs outsourced per service line (cleaning, pest, guarding, HVAC, grounds), single-source IFM vs best-of-breed, and the site-cluster structure across the archipelago
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities / Procurement
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4169_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4169_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4169_Task5" name="Facilities set the facilities strategy and standards (service levels, response…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities set the facilities strategy and standards (service levels, response times, sustainability, safety, customer-experience impact), aligned to corporate strategy (VS-33) and growth (VS-37)
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4169_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4169_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4169_Task6" name="Facilities document the model, obtain executive approval, sequence rollout with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities document the model, obtain executive approval, sequence rollout with OCM (VS-134), and resource the facilities org
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities / Finance
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4169_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4169_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4169_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4169_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4169_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-644 (ensure controlled execution — Facilities Management Strategy, IFM Provider &amp; SLA Governance (PA-138.1).) | - CTL-644: IFM operating model approved by COO; strategy aligned to corporate plan (VS-33)
Owner: Head of Facilities / Store Operations Support</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4169_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4169_Annotation8" targetRef="W4169_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4169_Flow10" sourceRef="W4169_Start3" targetRef="W4169_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4169_Flow11" sourceRef="W4169_Task4" targetRef="W4169_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4169_Flow12" sourceRef="W4169_Task5" targetRef="W4169_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4169_Flow13" sourceRef="W4169_Task6" targetRef="W4169_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
