    <bpmn:process id="W_W4171" name="W4171. Facilities Service Catalog &amp; SLA Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Operating-model setup; service review; site-type change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Service catalog across ~205 sites × service lines
Owner: Head of Facilities
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), DC Ops (VS-04), HQ Admin, Providers
Source: workflow W4171 — Facilities Service Catalog &amp; SLA Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4171_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4171_Lane1" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4171_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4171_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4171_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4171_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4171_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4171_Start3" name="Operating-model setup; service review; site-type change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4171_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4171_Task4" name="Facilities define the service catalog — hard services (HVAC, electrical…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities define the service catalog — hard services (HVAC, electrical, plumbing, fire systems, elevators, BMS) and soft services (cleaning, pest, guarding, grounds, waste, cafeteria, mailroom) — per site type (store/DC/HQ)
Responsible (R): Facilities / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4171_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4171_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4171_Task5" name="Facilities set SLAs per service (frequency, response/resolution times, quality…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities set SLAs per service (frequency, response/resolution times, quality standards) differentiated by site criticality (24/7 store vs DC vs HQ) and codify in provider contracts (W4170)
Responsible (R): Facilities
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4171_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4171_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4171_Task6" name="Facilities publish the catalog/SLA to sites and providers, train site staff on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities publish the catalog/SLA to sites and providers, train site staff on how to request/report, and govern SLA changes
Responsible (R): Facilities / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4171_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4171_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4171_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4171_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4171_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-644 (ensure controlled execution — Facilities Management Strategy, IFM Provider &amp; SLA Governance (PA-138.1).) | - CTL-644: service catalog boundary vs equipment maintenance (VS-20.3) documented; SLAs in contracts
Owner: Head of Facilities</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
