    <bpmn:process id="W_W4172" name="W4172. Facilities Asset Register &amp; Building Condition Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site acquisition/opening (VS-37); condition survey; capex trigger
Frequency: Annual survey + on change
Volume: ~205 buildings × fabric/systems (roof, structure, HVAC, fire, electrical, plumbing, elevators)
Owner: Facilities Asset Manager / Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20) / Fixed Assets (VS-35)
Participants: Real Estate (VS-97/VS-20), Engineering (VS-20.2), Capex (VS-40), DC Ops (VS-04)
Source: workflow W4172 — Facilities Asset Register &amp; Building Condition Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4172_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4172_Lane1" name="Facilities Asset Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4172_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4172_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4172_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4172_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4172_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4172_Start3" name="Site acquisition/opening (VS-37); condition survey; capex trigger">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4172_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4172_Task4" name="Facilities maintain the building/fabric asset register (building systems, age…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities maintain the building/fabric asset register (building systems, age, condition, warranty, replacement cost) distinct from FF&amp;E/equipment (VS-35/VS-20.3), integrated with the real-estate portfolio (VS-97)
Responsible (R): Facilities Asset Mgr / Real Estate
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4172_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4172_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4172_Task5" name="Facilities/Engineering conduct periodic building-condition surveys (roof…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities/Engineering conduct periodic building-condition surveys (roof, structure, HVAC, fire/life-safety, elevators, facade), rate condition, and identify capex/refurbishment triggers (links to VS-109 remodel, VS-40 capex)
Responsible (R): Facilities Asset Mgr / Engineering
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4172_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4172_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4172_Task6" name="Facilities feed condition data into capex planning (VS-40) and the…">
