    <bpmn:process id="W_W4176" name="W4176. Facilities Budget, Cost-to-Serve &amp; Vendor Performance Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Budget cycle; monthly review; vendor scorecard
Frequency: Monthly + annual budget
Volume: Facilities opex across ~205 sites (hard+soft services + utilities + maintenance)
Owner: Head of Facilities / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4/VS-34.3), Procurement (VS-34), Store Ops (VS-07), Providers
Source: workflow W4176 — Facilities Budget, Cost-to-Serve &amp; Vendor Performance Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4176_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4176_Lane1" name="Head of Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4176_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4176_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4176_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4176_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4176_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4176_Start3" name="Budget cycle; monthly review; vendor scorecard">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4176_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4176_Task4" name="Facilities/Finance build the facilities budget (per site/service line…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities/Finance build the facilities budget (per site/service line, utilities, maintenance, capex links to VS-40) with cost-to-serve baselines and benchmarks (PHP/sqm)
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities / Finance
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4176_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4176_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4176_Task5" name="Facilities/Procurement measure provider performance (SLA adherence W4171…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Facilities/Procurement measure provider performance (SLA adherence W4171, quality, cost, safety) via scorecards, manage consequences, and consolidate for leverage
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities / Procurement
Accountable (A): Head of Facilities
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4176_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4176_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4176_Task6" name="Facilities/Finance monitor spend vs budget, identify leakage/overruns, report…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Facilities/Finance monitor spend vs budget, identify leakage/overruns, report facilities cost-to-serve KPIs (W4192), and feed into OpEx (VS-133) and TBM where IT-facilities overlap
Responsible (R): Head of Facilities / Finance
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4176_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4176_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4176_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4176_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4176_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-139 (ensure facilities compliance &amp; vendor performance.) | - CTL-644: facilities budget vs actual monitored; provider scorecards with consequences; cost-to-serve benchmarked
Owner: Head of Facilities / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4176_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4176_Annotation8" targetRef="W4176_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
